msgstr ""
"Lati ṣe idiwọ iraye taara si awọn faili ti ko le ka, %1$sṣe imudojuiwọn si "
"Permissions Pro%2$s ki o si mu ẹya iraye si faili ṣiṣẹ."

#: classes/PublishPress/Permissions/UI/HintsItemExceptions.php:61
msgid "To customize editing permissions, enable the Editing Permissions feature."
msgstr ""
"Lati ṣe àṣà awọn ìfẹ́sẹ̀kẹ́sẹ̀ àtúnṣe, mu iṣẹ́ Àtúnṣe Awọn Ìfẹ́sẹ̀kẹ́sẹ̀ "
"ṣiṣẹ́."

#: classes/PublishPress/Permissions/UI/HintsMedia.php:14
